  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* AUR installation instructions by @shtrophic in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/23\r\n* Ttyd-Dockerfile  by @CrazyWolf13 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/27\r\n* Fix filters is null by @kiuber in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/39\r\n* Fix typos by @kianmeng in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/37\r\n* Add Reference to Third-Party Docker Image for Web Mode by @sdjnmxd in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/42\r\n* fixes  panic when AdGuard version lacks 'v' prefix by @maxschipper in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/48\r\n* docs: add -L flag to curl command for following redirects by @ciallo-agent in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/47\r\n* Fixes issues, and adds CI/CD by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/55\r\n* ci: makes docker workflow into matrix, faster by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/56\r\n* Even faster docker builds, no QEMU by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/58\r\n* Welcome screen data entry improvments, and API mem saftey by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/59\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @shtrophic made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/23\r\n* @CrazyWolf13 made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/27\r\n* @kiuber made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/39\r\n* @kianmeng made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/37\r\n* @sdjnmxd made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/42\r\n* @maxschipper made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/48\r\n* @ciallo-agent made their first contribution in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/47\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/compare/1.6.0...1.7.0",
